# Data Structures in C++

This repository contains my academic work and C++ implementations for the **Data Structures** course.

## Topics Covered

* Arrays
* Searching

  * Linear Search
  * Binary Search
* Sorting

  * Bubble Sort
  * Selection Sort
  * Insertion Sort
  * Merge Sort
* Stack
* Queue
* Linked Lists

  * Singly Linked List
  * Circular Singly Linked List
  * Doubly Linked List
* Basic C++ practice

## Repository Structure

```text
Data-Structures-in-Cpp/
│
├── Learn Basic C++/
├── Arrays/
├── Searching/
├── Sorting/
├── Stack/
├── Queue/
└── Linked List/
```

These programs were completed as part of my academic coursework and are intended for learning and practice.
